shsrv ELF loader
----------------
The loader diagnostic links elfldr.c and pt.c from ps5-payload-dev/shsrv.

Upstream: https://github.com/ps5-payload-dev/shsrv
Revision: 6f320637d56d344a0e7797753099e33238bbf146
Copyright (C) 2024 John Törnblom
License: GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version.

tools/fetch-loader.py retrieves these sources, their headers, and the upstream
LICENSE into vendor/shsrv and verifies the checksums in sources.lock.json.
The upstream copyright and license notices are preserved in the source files.
patches/loader/0001-explicit-spawn-context.patch adds explicit child environment
and working-directory arguments and propagates working-directory failures.
It temporarily applies the creator's existing capabilities to the child's
working-directory change before SDK startup, then restores the child's values.
Include the applicable license and corresponding source when distributing a
binary that incorporates this loader.

